          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6qs",
          "text": "It could benefit you immensely to hire an attorney to help you with a bicycle accident case in Colorado, especially if you have severe injuries or a challenging personal injury case. While a car insurance company may try to take advantage of you as an unrepresented claimant, it will not if you have a lawyer. The insurance company may offer a higher settlement than you would receive if you represented yourself. This can be critical if you have serious injuries that will require future care, such as physical therapy and rehabilitation. In addition, a lawyer will take care of the legwork of your case for you, from collecting evidence of fault to representing you at a personal injury trial, if necessary.",
