        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6rm",
          "text": "According to the Colorado Department of Transportation, there were 92,153 total traffic accidents in 2021. This included 16,050 accidents where the first harmful event was the vehicle striking a bicyclist or motorized bicycle. According to crash statistics, some of the most common causes of bicycle collisions in Colorado are:",
