          "text": ". This website can give you information about the roadway rules and statutes that apply to bicyclists in Thornton, as well as the responsibilities of other motorists. You may be able to use this information to understand who is at fault for your accident, as well as to gather evidence if a driver broke a law and crashed into you.",
